/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 54 0 R
/E (If you have poor mobility like most people do then going from exercise to exercise and training hard is a perfect recipe for injury. In fact I would go as far as to say you are guaranteed injury. Imagine training your butt off HIIT style for a couple months and then BOOM you hurt yourself or you start to develop pain in your knees, back or hips. Bye bye fat loss and hello sitting on the couch erasing everything you have trained so hard to achieve.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
